  "proposal": {
    "hypothesis": "The recovery module's retry field is a static 0, so transient (retryable) tool errors are never retried, causing tool_recovery and composition failures where a single transient timeout aborts the task. Making retry a general expression that fires only when the last error is retryable and non-permanent, and the attempt budget is not exhausted, will recover these cases without retrying permanent errors or mutating authority.",
