                "var": "attempt"
              },
              3
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "max_attempts": 3
    },
    "predicted_behavior": "On transient_error (retryable=1, permanent=0, attempt<3) the recovery module retries the same read-only tool, so tool_recovery and composition families that currently return UNKNOWN after one timeout will obtain the live token and produce the correct answer with tool_attempts 2-3. Permanent errors (retryable=0/permanent=1) still yield no retry, preserving tool_routing behavior.",
    "regression_risk": "Low-moderate: if a tool reports retryable but keeps failing, up to max_attempts=3 attempts are consumed, slightly increasing latency; no authority or policy changes since retry only re-invokes the already-selected read-only tool and never escalates to write tools."
